{"id":"633569","name":"白面碗托","author":"优子家的味道","authorId":"9910251","desc":"","cover":"images/633569/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面粉","amount":"适量"}],"sub":[{"name":"大蒜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"干辣椒面","amount":"适量"},{"name":"香菜","amount":"适量"},{"name":"熟芝麻","amount":"适量"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"面粉中放入一勺盐。","img":"images/633569/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"多次少量的倒入凉水。","img":"images/633569/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"搅至无颗粒糊状。","img":"images/633569/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"盘中刷油倒入适量面糊。","img":"images/633569/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"上笼蒸20分钟。","img":"images/633569/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"油热后放入蒜沫炒香。","img":"images/633569/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放入干辣椒面炒出辣味。","img":"images/633569/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"倒入老陈醋、生抽炒出锅气。","img":"images/633569/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"倒入适量开水，放入盐、十三香、香鸡精。","img":"images/633569/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"大火炖2分钟。","img":"images/633569/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"淋入水淀粉。","img":"images/633569/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"放入熟芝麻、味精搅拌均匀即可。","img":"images/633569/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"碗托晾凉切成条状。","img":"images/633569/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"装入盘中。","img":"images/633569/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"浇上灵魂料汁。","img":"images/633569/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"撒上香菜。","img":"images/633569/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"香辣可口、美味漂亮，妥妥的人间美味！","img":"images/633569/step_17.jpg"}],"tips":"上笼蒸时确保碗托蒸熟，晾凉后再切，防止粘连。 \n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：煮锅、炒锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}